  SeparableDomainLeaf.majorant S2L0R1R2R0L1L2L0L1L2L0L1L2L0R1L.widths S2L0R1R2R0L1L2L0L1L2L0L1L2L0R1L.valid a hi 3 terms coefficients partialU partialV coefficients_checked partialU_checked partialV_checked gram canonical distance
    (by norm_num) (by norm_num [a]) log_upper
    (by norm_num [gram]) (by norm_num [canonical]) (by norm_num [distance]) ident checked
